G04 Blocks (row A y=58, row B y=22):*
G04   A1 at (15, 58) mm: 292 pads, 0.8 mm pitch, 0.4 mm square G36 regions, concentric ring depopulation (real stencil layout)*
G04   A2 at (40, 58) mm: 400 pads, 0.8 mm pitch, 0.4 mm squares with 0.08 mm arc corners as G36 regions (exact path renderer)*
G04   A3 at (65, 58) mm: 1600 pads, 0.4 mm pitch, 0.2 mm round flashes, full array*
G04   A4 at (90, 58) mm: 540 pads, 0.5 mm pitch, 0.25 mm round flashes, five perimeter rows only*
G04   A5 at (111, 58) mm: 256 pads, 1.0 mm pitch, 0.5 mm round flashes*
G04   B1 at (15, 22) mm: 1024 pads, 0.5 mm pitch, 0.25 mm square G36 regions (triangle path)*
G04   B2 at (40, 22) mm: 1024 pads, 0.5 mm pitch, 0.25 mm octagon macro flashes (triangle-template path)*
G04   B3 at (65, 22) mm: 576 pads, 0.65 mm pitch, checkerboard of 0.3 mm rectangle and 0.25 x 0.45 mm oval flashes*
G04   B4 at (90, 22) mm: 2314 pads, 0.35 mm hex (staggered) pitch, 0.18 mm round flashes*
G04   B5 at (111, 22) mm: 400 pads, 0.8 mm pitch, checkerboard of 0.4 mm and 0.22 mm round flashes*
